Package: jscTools
Type: Package
Title: Miscellaneous Helper Tools Developed by and for Stuart Carlton
Version: 1.1.0
Date: 2026-01-27
Authors@R: person("Stuart", "Carlton",
                  email = "stuart@jscarlton.net",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of tools and scripts for data analysis, including
    functions for importing and cleaning Qualtrics survey data, analyzing
    Likert scale responses, calculating composite scale scores, creating
    publication-ready tables, and custom ggplot2 themes. Designed for
    social science research workflows.
